# ── Secrets / local configuration ──────────────────────────────────────
# Holds the real DB connection string + JWT signing key — never commit it.
# Local overrides belong in appsettings.Development.json (tracked, dev-only values).
backend/SRMS.API/appsettings.json
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── .NET build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/

